# W30, b (k7, another phase): takes the gate to stag0201 while a is in dng205b1: I1a enters b into a's instance as a
# guest in a new stage group at stag0201 with a's story (key item 9) and settings; b walks to dng205b1 and joins a there.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until frames>=120 fail key:9=1
log own story at home
idle until epoch>=@200
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until frames>=120 fail key:9=0
log b plays a's story
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng205b1,control
wander 0 0 30 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined a in the ruins
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control
idle until frames>=120 fail key:9=1
log own story again
